; AlifeTactics overlay restoring vanilla xr_eat_medkit's inventory-consumption path.
;
; Vanilla xr_eat_medkit.script:63-64 reads `medkits` and `bandages` from `[plugin]`
; via parse_list, but vanilla ai_tweaks\xr_eat_medkit.ltx writes [plugin] without
; those keys. parse_list returns {} so xr_eat_medkit.script:124 for-loop iterates
; zero times -- NPCs never consume real medkits or bandages despite the script
; being enabled. Only the once-per-life healing_charge fallback at :136-143 fires
; (50% of stalkers, one consume_medkit call per lifetime, medkit=nil, no
; alife_release_id call on a real item).
;
; Adding the two lists here makes the for-loop find items in NPC inventory, set
; self.item, advance to stage 1, and call consume_medkit(npc, real_item, kind)
; with alife_release_id firing on the real game_object.
;
; Vanilla items only. medkit_ai1/2/3 are vanilla NPC-only medkits that AlifePlus
; already restocks via [ap_buy_sell_keep]; without this overlay they sat unused.

![plugin]
medkits  = medkit, medkit_army, medkit_scientic, medkit_ai1, medkit_ai2, medkit_ai3
bandages = bandage
